00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:12,070
Issei, your Sacred Gear holds the feelings

2
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:15,070
of all the previous Red Dragon
Emperors before you.

3
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:17,490
Their negative feelings are very strong.

4
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:19,450
