Azazel!

7776
00:19:25,510 --> 00:19:27,470
Sorry for interrupting your fun.

7777
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:29,560
Y-You're wrong!

7778
00:19:29,560 --> 00:19:31,230
So, why are you here?

7779
00:19:31,440 --> 00:19:35,440
Our little Great Devil Queen is
calling for all of us to gather.

7780
00:19:38,280 --> 00:19:39,820
Oh, Hyoudou.

7781
00:19:39,820 --> 00:19:42,110
Hey, Saji. How'd you like Kyoto?

7782
00:19:42,110 --> 00:19:44,030
I'm part of the student council.

7783
00:19:44,030 --> 00:19:47,080
I was helping the teachers and
didn't get a chance to go anywhere.

7784
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:49,710
Even during trips, it must be hard on you.

7785
00:19:49,710 --> 00:19:50,540
Here!

7786
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:55,590
The poultry here is exceptional!
Eat up, everyone!

7787
00:19:55,590 --> 00:19:59,210
Lady Leviathan, why are you here?

7788
00:19:59,800 --> 00:20:04,680
For work. I came to forge an alliance
with the youkai of Kyoto.

7789
00:20:05,180 --> 00:20:08,810
It's just, something terrible has happened.

7790
00:20:08,810 --> 00:20:09,890
Something terrible?

7791
00:20:10,310 --> 00:20:13,190
The leader of the Kyoto youkai,

7792
00:20:13,190 --> 00:20:15,860
a nine-tailed who kept them
all together, has gone missing.

7793
00:20:16,230 --> 00:20:17,360
That...

7794
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:18,610
Could it be...

7795
00:20:18,780 --> 00:20:20,400
At Fushimi Inari...

7796
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:21,700
That attack on us...

7797
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:27,080
Oh, seems like things were
pretty tough for you, too.

7798
00:20:27,080 --> 00:20:30,610
I heard your report from Azazel.

7799
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:33,170
I believe it to be the case.

7800
00:20:33,170 --> 00:20:35,750
The ones behind it are probably...

7801
00:20:35,750 --> 00:20:37,610
The Chaos Brigade.

7802
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:39,640
Chaos Brigade...

7803
00:20:40,050 --> 00:20:44,450
Damn, our hands are full taking
care of the students right now!

7804
00:20:44,760 --> 00:20:46,390
They really got us this time.

7805
00:20:47,470 --> 00:20:50,600
There are youkai that are
willing to help us in Kyoto.

7806
00:20:50,600 --> 00:20:54,140
We plan to help them through those contacts.

7807
00:20:54,600 --> 00:20:55,980
I'll move as well.

7808
00:20:55,980 --> 00:20:58,520
U-Um, what should we do?

7809
00:20:58,520 --> 00:21:00,730
For now, enjoy the trip.

7810
00:21:00,730 --> 00:21:02,570
Huh? But...

7811
00:21:02,570 --> 00:21:04,150
I'll call for you if something happens.

7812
00:21:04,610 --> 00:21:08,260
For brats like you, aren't class
trips important memories?

7813
00:21:08,910 --> 00:21:13,660
We adults will do what we can,
so enjoy Kyoto for now.

7814
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:15,590
Azazel...

7815
00:21:16,330 --> 00:21:19,710
That's right, make sure to
enjoy Kyoto to the fullest!

7816
00:21:19,710 --> 00:21:21,550
I plan to do the same!

7817
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:26,050
Now, let's enjoy the food!

7818
00:21:26,050 --> 00:21:29,350
For now, we can only fill
our bellies! Well, then!

7819
00:21:29,350 --> 00:21:31,770
Thanks for the food!

7820
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:42,270
People who wish to destroy the
current system, the Chaos Brigade.

7821
00:21:42,780 --> 00:21:46,010
It isn't only made up of the Old Satan Faction.

7822
00:21:46,660 --> 00:21:47,770
There are others, too.

7823
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:51,450
Looks like things are more
serious than we thought.

7824
00:21:51,450 --> 00:21:56,000
Yes, we should prepare ourselves
for the worst-case scenario.

7825
00:21:56,210 --> 00:21:59,240
Yes, even if big sister Rias isn't here...

7826
00:22:00,420 --> 00:22:04,010
I want to protect the city of Kyoto
that President loves so much!

